# The repository stores LF regardless of the checkout platform. .editorconfig
# tells editors the same thing; this is the layer that survives an editor that
# does not read it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Vendored Zoekt reference material. `just docs-fetch` writes exactly what the
# upstream server sent, so git must not rewrite a byte of it.
docs/zoekt/** -text

# Binary assets, so git never guesses.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
